WEBVTT

00:07.616 --> 00:09.376
[If you don't turn yourself in,
your limbs will rot and you'll die]

00:37.833 --> 00:41.193
[All characters and events are fictional,
and any resemblance is coincidental]

00:41.193 --> 00:43.800
[Scenes with children and animals were filmed
safely under professional supervision]

00:43.800 --> 00:48.233
But please tell me your story too.

00:48.233 --> 00:50.933
It's no fun if I'm the only one talking.

00:50.933 --> 00:53.000
You tell yours,

00:53.000 --> 00:54.700
and I'll tell mine.

00:54.700 --> 00:59.633
That way, we can complete our story.

00:59.633 --> 01:00.933
"Our story"?

01:00.933 --> 01:03.933
Yes, ours.

01:13.733 --> 01:18.067
First, tell me about the person
you said you hated the most.

01:18.067 --> 01:21.967
When you first met them,
and why you came to hate them.

01:25.400 --> 01:28.033
Come on.

01:28.033 --> 01:30.400
You didn't hate them
from the beginning, did you?

01:32.667 --> 01:34.467
From what I've seen in life,

01:34.467 --> 01:37.600
hatred doesn't just appear out of nowhere.

01:37.600 --> 01:40.700
To build up like that, there has
to be something underneath first.

01:40.700 --> 01:43.533
Friendship, affection, something like that.

01:43.533 --> 01:48.633
And it's only when something like that
gets crushed that hatred arises.

02:14.567 --> 02:17.567
[Episode 4]

02:52.733 --> 02:55.133
[Examination Room]
It's still a case of strangulation.

02:56.233 --> 02:59.833
But something feels off.

02:59.833 --> 03:01.667
What is it?

03:02.333 --> 03:04.567
What's different about this case is that...

03:12.867 --> 03:16.633
The chest was slashed with a razor blade.

03:19.833 --> 03:21.600
It's the first time
the perpetrator has done this.

03:26.900 --> 03:29.467
Was that done
while the victim was still alive?

03:32.346 --> 03:34.816
Oh, well...

03:34.816 --> 03:36.867
And this was found inside the body.

03:38.533 --> 03:40.933
He stuffed the genitals with it.

03:45.433 --> 03:47.100
What's that?

03:55.833 --> 03:57.300
What's this?

03:57.300 --> 03:59.133
It's a bribe.

04:16.640 --> 04:23.227
[Restricted Area, Authorized Personnel Only]

04:26.100 --> 04:28.400
Don't dwell on it. Just go.

04:28.400 --> 04:30.367
It's not your case anymore.

04:31.667 --> 04:33.267
Cha Si Young!

04:34.667 --> 04:36.267
Si Young.

04:39.533 --> 04:41.933
I've got to catch that punk.

04:46.867 --> 04:48.700
Let's catch him together.

04:51.700 --> 04:53.333
Together?

04:54.767 --> 04:56.833
Yeah.

04:56.833 --> 04:58.467
Together.

05:01.167 --> 05:03.033
Shall we be friends?

05:04.733 --> 05:06.133
I heard you're smart.

05:06.133 --> 05:07.967
I am too.

05:07.967 --> 05:10.000
Wouldn't it be nice if we could be friends?

05:11.333 --> 05:13.167
I don't need friends.

05:14.467 --> 05:16.067
Then what about money?

05:20.633 --> 05:22.333
Want to tutor me?

05:23.100 --> 05:24.700
I'll pay you.

05:27.392 --> 05:30.032
Give it here.

05:30.912 --> 05:33.233
Try solving this.

05:33.233 --> 05:34.233
Here.

05:34.233 --> 05:36.900
Oh, right. This is it.

05:41.933 --> 05:43.900
What?

05:43.900 --> 05:45.533
You got it right!

05:48.133 --> 05:49.700
You explain things really well.

05:49.700 --> 05:50.833
Maybe even better than my math teacher.

05:50.833 --> 05:52.967
It's just that he's bad at it.

05:54.100 --> 05:55.200
I need the bathroom.

05:55.200 --> 05:56.800
Bathroom?

05:57.867 --> 05:59.100
Solve this for me.

05:59.100 --> 06:00.733
Okay.

06:25.600 --> 06:27.267
Try this.

06:34.133 --> 06:35.767
It's delicious.

06:35.767 --> 06:38.100
Tae Joo, where did you get this?

06:38.100 --> 06:40.033
My friend gave me this.

06:40.033 --> 06:43.500
That's a good friend. Ask for more, okay?

06:43.500 --> 06:45.333
Okay.

06:45.333 --> 06:46.933
Eat up.

07:13.867 --> 07:15.600
- You're leaving?
- Yeah.

07:15.600 --> 07:17.233
Tae Joo.

07:18.067 --> 07:19.700
Huh?

07:21.067 --> 07:23.360
Let's go

07:23.360 --> 07:25.434
to the same college.

07:27.167 --> 07:28.800
Okay.

07:31.933 --> 07:33.533
Get home safely.

07:35.367 --> 07:37.000
Oh, right.

07:37.824 --> 07:40.922
[Middle School Mathematics]

07:40.922 --> 07:42.400
Jeez.

07:42.400 --> 07:44.200
I forgot.

07:46.133 --> 07:47.900
Well, I'll give it to him next time.

07:50.433 --> 07:52.633
Why are you so late?

07:52.633 --> 07:55.033
Get Sun Young something to eat.
She's been whining since earlier.

07:55.033 --> 07:56.633
Mom!

07:59.333 --> 08:01.800
Can I go to college?

08:01.800 --> 08:05.067
Go, earn the money and go.

08:14.433 --> 08:16.033
Si Young!

08:20.033 --> 08:21.900
You've got something there.

08:21.900 --> 08:23.833
Keep your hands off me.

08:24.667 --> 08:26.300
So filthy.

08:26.300 --> 08:28.700
- What's wrong?
- Stop it!

08:31.667 --> 08:34.133
Why didn't you tell me?

08:34.133 --> 08:36.300
That your mom works as a hostess?

08:41.067 --> 08:43.533
Do you want me to spill

08:43.533 --> 08:45.300
who you really are?

08:46.367 --> 08:48.567
Everyone should know what they need to know.

08:51.567 --> 08:53.800
Please don't say anything.

08:53.800 --> 08:55.467
I'm begging you.

09:05.167 --> 09:07.300
Then will you do whatever I say?

09:08.600 --> 09:10.233
Yeah.

09:14.367 --> 09:16.033
Anything?

09:16.833 --> 09:18.467
Anything.

09:27.633 --> 09:31.533
[Bang Kyung Moon Clinic]

09:32.700 --> 09:34.767
Si Young.

09:34.767 --> 09:36.533
Let's catch him together.

09:37.367 --> 09:38.967
Together?

09:42.967 --> 09:44.600
Together.

09:46.800 --> 09:48.400
That sounds nice.

09:50.367 --> 09:51.967
Let's give it a shot.

09:52.633 --> 09:54.000
[The police let the suspect slip
right past them]

09:54.000 --> 09:55.267
Take a look.

09:55.267 --> 09:58.000
They say this is
what the serial killer looks like.

09:59.267 --> 10:03.000
We didn't even see a strand of his hair.
Does that make any sense?

10:03.000 --> 10:05.267
We did see his hair.

10:05.267 --> 10:07.167
We also got his blood type from there.

10:07.167 --> 10:10.600
So you're proud of
just getting his blood type?

10:10.600 --> 10:14.067
We're already checking people
with similar priors.

10:14.067 --> 10:17.440
- We'll catch him soon enough.
- Darn it.

10:19.033 --> 10:21.267
So, what evidence did you find in this case?

10:22.833 --> 10:24.233
I said, what did you get?

10:24.233 --> 10:25.633
Not much, sir.

10:25.633 --> 10:30.600
Hair, body hair, bloodstains
from the clothes, all type B.

10:30.600 --> 10:34.000
Mr. Kim, you got a problem with me?

10:37.367 --> 10:38.733
I said, any problem with that?

10:38.733 --> 10:40.833
- No, sir.
- It sounds like you do.

10:40.833 --> 10:42.500
What is it?

10:44.467 --> 10:46.080
Chief,

10:46.080 --> 10:49.733
could you hold off
on processing Kang Tae Joo's resignation?

10:49.733 --> 10:52.133
Jeon Kyeong Ho's medical report was forged,

10:52.133 --> 10:54.900
- and...
- Did you even read this article?

10:54.900 --> 10:57.067
Who's the one that let the killer slip?

10:57.067 --> 10:59.600
It's Kang Tae Joo! Kang Tae Joo!

11:01.400 --> 11:04.167
Hello, Detective Chief Heo
of Kangseng Police.

11:04.167 --> 11:06.267
Yes.

11:06.267 --> 11:07.267
Just a moment, please.

11:07.267 --> 11:08.867
Chief.

11:09.633 --> 11:11.328
Hello?

11:11.328 --> 11:13.000
Who is this?

11:14.867 --> 11:18.400
Yes, this is Park Eun Kyu,
Chief of Kangseng Police.

11:18.400 --> 11:20.800
Yes, go ahead, Superintendent.

11:21.867 --> 11:23.233
- Superintendent?
- What?

11:23.233 --> 11:25.367
You mean Kang Tae Joo?

11:29.200 --> 11:30.848
That can't be.

11:30.848 --> 11:33.433
His resignation hasn't
even been accepted yet.

11:36.698 --> 11:37.906
[Gyeongbuk apples]

11:42.467 --> 11:45.067
You're back? How?

11:46.533 --> 11:49.467
Maybe the Chief's been too busy.

11:49.467 --> 11:52.000
It seems
my resignation hasn't been processed yet.

11:52.000 --> 11:53.733
That's even possible?

11:54.906 --> 11:57.100
Hey!

11:57.100 --> 11:59.233
That hurt? Come with me.

12:08.300 --> 12:10.600
Hey, what's going on?

12:10.600 --> 12:13.100
Tell me everything in detail.

12:13.100 --> 12:16.667
We're short-staffed anyway,
so just take it as a stroke of luck.

12:16.667 --> 12:18.533
That's not the point.

12:18.533 --> 12:22.667
Why would a superintendent step in
over a sergeant's resignation?

12:22.667 --> 12:24.100
A superintendent?

12:24.100 --> 12:27.000
What, you didn't know, either? Seriously?

12:27.000 --> 12:29.133
Well...

12:29.133 --> 12:30.233
Who's this senior superintendent?

12:30.233 --> 12:31.233
Cha Jun Young.

12:31.233 --> 12:33.033
You don't know Superintendent Cha Jun Young?

12:33.033 --> 12:35.167
The youngest ever
to become a superintendent in Korea.

12:35.167 --> 12:39.610
He's currently on assignment
at the Blue House, and he's a big shot.

12:39.610 --> 12:42.944
Well, a superintendent?

12:42.944 --> 12:44.800
That's huge.

12:46.733 --> 12:50.100
Seriously, is he backing you?

12:52.267 --> 12:53.600
Let's just say he is.

12:53.600 --> 12:55.767
It's not entirely wrong.

13:00.200 --> 13:02.112
What is he talking about?

13:02.112 --> 13:03.328
Wow.

13:03.328 --> 13:06.867
A superintendent stepping in
over a low-ranking cop.

13:07.500 --> 13:09.133
I'm sorry.

13:10.800 --> 13:15.633
This Kang Tae Joo or whatever his name is,
he'd better be worth it.

13:15.633 --> 13:17.667
He will be.

13:18.867 --> 13:20.900
And the Kangseng Serial Murder Case.

13:20.900 --> 13:24.300
Don't let anyone else steal it.
Finish it with your own hands.

13:24.300 --> 13:26.933
Father is preparing for the election,
so if you can't help,

13:26.933 --> 13:29.533
at least don't be a liability, got it?

13:30.300 --> 13:32.233
I'll keep that in mind.

13:32.233 --> 13:33.504
Good,

13:33.504 --> 13:35.200
make sure you do that.

13:38.433 --> 13:41.833
I heard you're seeing
Chairman Kim Tae Seop's daughter lately?

13:44.167 --> 13:46.867
She seems like a fine woman.

13:47.514 --> 13:49.136
Jeez.

13:50.200 --> 13:51.633
What,

13:51.633 --> 13:54.933
you're trying to go into politics too?

14:01.000 --> 14:03.133
Well, Cha Si Young.

14:05.033 --> 14:08.000
You know what happens
when a sparrow chases a stork?

14:09.000 --> 14:11.700
It gets torn apart.

14:12.736 --> 14:16.167
You're old enough to know your place.

14:16.167 --> 14:19.600
Why is that so hard for you?

14:19.600 --> 14:21.367
I don't get it.

14:40.000 --> 14:43.567
Hey, you finished the list
of Kim Min Ji's belongings?

14:43.567 --> 14:45.167
Not yet.

14:46.133 --> 14:49.333
What about her movements that day?
Did you check?

14:49.333 --> 14:51.533
Not that, either.

14:51.533 --> 14:54.167
Then what exactly have you been doing?

14:56.800 --> 14:59.520
I don't think someone
who quit and then came back

14:59.520 --> 15:02.333
can say that to me.

15:03.667 --> 15:05.333
What's wrong with him?

15:05.333 --> 15:07.033
Heatstroke?

15:11.900 --> 15:13.500
Park Dae Ho!

15:15.200 --> 15:16.800
Come out.

15:19.767 --> 15:21.467
Rookie,

15:21.467 --> 15:22.767
just apologize.

15:22.767 --> 15:26.100
Apologize for what? Since you've already
gone this far, just go all in.

15:26.100 --> 15:27.867
You punk.

15:37.067 --> 15:40.667
That guy's got guts.

15:48.467 --> 15:50.067
Eat up.

15:54.933 --> 15:57.733
Go on. Why are you mad at me?

15:58.933 --> 16:01.367
- I'm not.
- Seems you are.

16:01.367 --> 16:03.000
Say it.

16:12.467 --> 16:14.100
Honestly,

16:14.900 --> 16:16.933
I was disappointed.

16:16.933 --> 16:19.367
Because you quit too easily.

16:19.367 --> 16:21.267
After you came,

16:21.267 --> 16:23.933
I learned what to focus on in cases,

16:23.933 --> 16:26.267
and how to approach suspects.

16:26.267 --> 16:27.800
I learned those things

16:27.800 --> 16:30.100
and I wanted to learn more and do better.

16:30.100 --> 16:33.633
I really wanted to catch the killer
together with you.

16:33.633 --> 16:36.500
I assumed you felt the same. But...

16:36.500 --> 16:38.367
I just ran off, huh?

16:41.367 --> 16:43.000
But

16:44.067 --> 16:46.600
I didn't quit easily.

16:48.767 --> 16:51.267
It was really hard for me to quit.

16:52.067 --> 16:53.700
And...

16:55.100 --> 16:57.933
coming back was even harder than that.

16:59.333 --> 17:02.304
I had to give up a lot

17:02.304 --> 17:04.267
to get back in.

17:06.533 --> 17:07.600
What did you have to give up?

17:07.600 --> 17:09.933
That's none of your business.

17:11.367 --> 17:13.327
I met Min Ji

17:13.327 --> 17:15.433
the other day.

17:17.067 --> 17:22.167
She told me not to quit.
Otherwise, who would catch the suspect?

17:22.167 --> 17:24.767
She told me to catch the suspect.

17:24.767 --> 17:27.733
[Kangseng Bookstore]
Can't you not quit being a cop?

17:27.733 --> 17:30.867
I want you to catch him yourself, sir.

17:30.867 --> 17:32.133
It's a bribe.

17:32.133 --> 17:35.367
When you eat it,
just think it over twice more.

17:35.367 --> 17:38.000
Okay? Bye!

17:41.633 --> 17:44.400
So that's why you came back?

17:44.400 --> 17:46.033
No.

17:48.000 --> 17:50.400
I just can't take it anymore

17:52.233 --> 17:54.467
unless I catch that guy.

17:56.433 --> 17:58.300
That's why I came back.

18:01.867 --> 18:04.000
So cut me some slack.

18:04.000 --> 18:06.500
Who am I to do that?

18:08.767 --> 18:11.767
I'm sorry I was sulking, sir.

18:11.767 --> 18:16.033
And I'm glad you're back.

18:20.433 --> 18:22.933
This place is really good, eat up.

18:27.433 --> 18:31.300
[National Saemaeul Leaders Convention]

18:31.300 --> 18:33.400
Hey, Detective Kang!

18:33.400 --> 18:35.467
I almost forgot your face.
How many years has it been?

18:35.467 --> 18:39.367
Wow, you haven't aged a bit. Still the same.

18:39.367 --> 18:40.933
Has your son been discharged?

18:40.933 --> 18:43.667
That was ages ago.

18:43.667 --> 18:46.400
Don't ask when you don't even care.

18:46.400 --> 18:47.867
By the way, the total is off.

18:47.867 --> 18:49.267
We had two bowls.

18:49.267 --> 18:51.133
Why are you paying for my son's jjajangmyeon?

18:51.133 --> 18:52.467
Who's your son?

18:52.467 --> 18:53.567
Huh?

18:53.567 --> 18:55.167
Him!

18:55.167 --> 18:56.567
This is my family's place.

18:56.567 --> 18:59.533
It's Dae Ho Chinese Restaurant.
Didn't you know?

19:01.533 --> 19:03.967
He's my junior.

19:03.967 --> 19:05.033
I'll pay for him, ma'am.

19:05.033 --> 19:08.567
Alright, thanks for the meal.
We're heading out.

19:08.567 --> 19:10.800
Mom, I'm off!

19:10.800 --> 19:12.667
Sir, let's go together!

19:12.667 --> 19:14.800
Look how happy he is.

19:16.167 --> 19:18.167
Sir, wait for me!

19:25.567 --> 19:29.333
[Exclusive: Face of Kangseng
Serial Murder Suspect Obtained]

19:31.833 --> 19:33.733
There might still be a way.

19:33.733 --> 19:34.800
What way?

19:34.800 --> 19:36.608
Well,

19:36.608 --> 19:38.800
I'll let you know when I'm certain.

19:38.800 --> 19:43.700
I'm going to help you catch the suspect,
so just wait.

19:45.267 --> 19:47.667
Unbelievable, Seo Ji Won.

20:07.600 --> 20:11.500
[The police let the suspect slip
right past them]

20:24.433 --> 20:27.367
[Kangseng Daily]
Hey, don't get it wrong.

20:27.367 --> 20:29.400
I didn't write that article, okay?

20:29.400 --> 20:31.300
I know perfectly well
you lost him because of me that day.

20:31.300 --> 20:34.200
So how could I write an article like that?
Right?

20:34.200 --> 20:35.233
But it was your byline.

20:35.233 --> 20:38.733
The editor changed it
without even telling me.

20:38.733 --> 20:41.216
I didn't come here to argue about that.

20:41.216 --> 20:43.700
Just give me the photo.

20:43.700 --> 20:45.376
Yeah, this is it.

20:53.633 --> 20:57.733
By the way, why didn't you tell me
you went to school with Mr. Cha?

20:57.733 --> 20:58.767
What's the big deal?

20:58.767 --> 21:01.233
He said he wanted to get close to you.

21:01.233 --> 21:05.000
Didn't he send me that recording to help you?

21:05.000 --> 21:07.000
There was no camera at the scene.

21:07.000 --> 21:08.600
Oh.

21:09.667 --> 21:12.767
I hid it midway,
so the suspect wouldn't notice.

21:12.767 --> 21:14.167
Why are you only telling me this now?

21:14.167 --> 21:15.700
What else could I do?

21:15.700 --> 21:18.367
The police found nothing that day,
and you were cornered.

21:18.367 --> 21:22.600
Was I supposed to ask you
to find a camera the killer might have taken too?

21:25.400 --> 21:27.600
Is this that punk?

21:27.600 --> 21:30.800
Yeah, it's shaky. But see this?

21:30.800 --> 21:32.567
He covered his face.

21:33.700 --> 21:35.533
Ms. Kim Mi Yeon didn't mention that.

21:35.533 --> 21:39.133
So he only covered his face
in front of me? Why?

21:45.267 --> 21:47.100
This handkerchief looks familiar.

21:47.100 --> 21:51.600
It is a bit unusual,
but this alone isn't enough to find the suspect.

21:51.600 --> 21:53.333
True.

21:59.400 --> 22:04.233
Taking a leave?
The kids must be really disappointed.

22:05.000 --> 22:06.300
Sorry, I feel bad.

22:06.300 --> 22:07.600
Don't be.

22:07.600 --> 22:10.233
Just take a short break and come back.

22:10.233 --> 22:11.744
Okay,

22:11.744 --> 22:13.300
I'll come back for my things later.

22:13.300 --> 22:14.333
Alright.

22:14.333 --> 22:17.267
- Thank you.
- Yeah, go ahead.

22:22.200 --> 22:25.467
Are you that busy lately?

22:25.467 --> 22:27.533
I might forget your face at this rate.

22:28.900 --> 22:30.200
Oh, sorry.

22:30.200 --> 22:32.800
I should've been more thoughtful,

22:32.800 --> 22:34.767
but the cases just keep coming.

22:34.767 --> 22:37.567
I know it's because of the cases.

22:37.567 --> 22:40.933
I'm not that inconsiderate.

22:41.733 --> 22:43.767
But you could've at least called.

22:43.767 --> 22:47.333
Alright. I'll call you every day from now on.

22:47.333 --> 22:50.467
No, not every day.

22:50.467 --> 22:53.567
Just once in a while when you think of me.

22:54.600 --> 22:57.120
Then I guess I'll have to call you every day.

22:59.567 --> 23:03.133
Stop it, you're really embarrassing me.

23:03.133 --> 23:05.100
Stop teasing me.

23:09.600 --> 23:11.533
You're heading home, right?

23:11.533 --> 23:13.500
I'll give you a ride.

23:14.467 --> 23:16.800
If you're going out of your way,
I'd rather not.

23:16.800 --> 23:20.733
I'm not. I just want to
spend more time with you.

23:23.133 --> 23:25.312
Oh my, Hee Jin!

23:26.667 --> 23:27.700
It's been a while.

23:27.700 --> 23:29.333
Who is he?

23:31.333 --> 23:33.700
Prosecutor Cha Si Young.

23:33.700 --> 23:35.333
Prosecutor...

23:36.100 --> 23:39.167
Oh my, I didn't know there was
such a handsome prosecutor.

23:39.167 --> 23:40.867
Hey, you sure picked a good one.

23:40.867 --> 23:43.233
Thank you for the compliment.

23:43.233 --> 23:48.467
Since you're a prosecutor,
you must have single colleagues, huh?

23:48.467 --> 23:51.600
- I do.
- Then please introduce me to some.

23:51.600 --> 23:52.600
Sure.

23:52.600 --> 23:57.167
But Si Young's been swamped lately.
Not sure he has time for that.

23:57.167 --> 24:00.167
You know, the serial murders?

24:00.167 --> 24:02.100
That's his case.

24:03.100 --> 24:04.800
Well, if he ever has time...

24:04.800 --> 24:06.567
Si Young, you said you are busy, right?

24:06.567 --> 24:08.200
We should go.

24:08.200 --> 24:09.833
See you next time.

24:16.633 --> 24:19.433
I guess you weren't that close after all.

24:20.467 --> 24:22.400
Was it that obvious?

24:22.400 --> 24:23.667
It was really obvious.

24:23.667 --> 24:25.733
Oh no.

24:26.567 --> 24:31.300
We were close in middle school,
but we just drifted apart somehow.

24:31.300 --> 24:33.433
"Somehow"?

24:33.433 --> 24:35.933
Turns out

24:35.933 --> 24:38.933
her mom was a mistress.

24:39.833 --> 24:41.700
How vulgar.

24:43.000 --> 24:46.500
If I'd known earlier,
I wouldn't have been close to her.

24:50.933 --> 24:52.933
Where did you park?

24:56.100 --> 24:58.133
Sorry,

24:58.133 --> 25:02.067
I forgot I have a meeting this afternoon.

25:02.067 --> 25:05.033
I'm sorry, but I think I need to go now.

25:05.033 --> 25:07.100
You can get home by yourself, right?

25:07.100 --> 25:08.933
My apologies.

25:08.933 --> 25:10.533
Si Young!

25:14.300 --> 25:16.100
What's going on?

25:24.800 --> 25:29.600
[Certificate: Cha Jun Young]

25:31.800 --> 25:34.200
From now on, you'll live in this house.

25:34.200 --> 25:36.233
With your father and your brother.

25:36.233 --> 25:37.500
How does that sound?

25:37.500 --> 25:39.200
My brother?

25:39.200 --> 25:43.133
Si Young, you should
study hard like your brother.

25:43.133 --> 25:44.733
Okay?

25:49.633 --> 25:53.567
Mom, who is that?

25:56.762 --> 25:57.833
Jeez.

25:57.833 --> 25:59.600
- Hey, sir.
- Yes?

25:59.600 --> 26:02.133
Take that off, quickly!

26:02.133 --> 26:04.233
No, not that! The photo!

26:04.233 --> 26:05.867
Okay.

26:19.967 --> 26:22.067
Miss, are you okay?

26:22.067 --> 26:24.733
- Yes. Thank you.
- Oh my.

26:24.733 --> 26:26.433
Are you alright?

26:26.433 --> 26:27.533
Oh, yes.

26:27.533 --> 26:28.667
Not hurt?

26:28.667 --> 26:30.333
No.

26:30.333 --> 26:31.433
- Thank you.
- Sure you're okay?

26:31.433 --> 26:33.733
Yes, I'm fine.

26:33.733 --> 26:37.792
Oh? You're my brother's friend, right?

26:39.433 --> 26:41.400
But are you really okay?

26:41.400 --> 26:43.000
Let's go to the hospital just in case.

26:43.000 --> 26:45.248
No, I'm really fine.

26:45.248 --> 26:46.805
Huh?

26:49.408 --> 26:52.267
- Huh?
- I said I'm fine...

26:54.733 --> 26:57.100
Where did that pretty sound come from?

26:58.200 --> 27:00.922
You don't seem fine at all.

27:03.867 --> 27:06.633
[Italian Bakery]

27:06.633 --> 27:08.633
Here, have some.

27:08.633 --> 27:11.600
Oh, this is a lot.

27:12.800 --> 27:16.267
From what I heard, it sounded pretty urgent,

27:16.267 --> 27:18.133
so maybe you should grab a bite.

27:20.633 --> 27:23.367
Oh, how embarrassing.

27:26.400 --> 27:29.670
It's kind of sad that I'm feeling hungry

27:29.670 --> 27:32.067
even in a situation like this.

27:32.067 --> 27:34.400
What situation?

27:34.400 --> 27:36.633
I've taken a leave from school.

27:36.633 --> 27:38.144
Why?

27:38.752 --> 27:41.767
Is it because of Jeon Kyeong Ho?

27:41.767 --> 27:43.967
Didn't he already quit the school?

27:45.333 --> 27:47.467
That has nothing to do with it.

27:47.467 --> 27:50.200
I just wanted to take a break.

27:53.067 --> 27:55.833
I don't have any specific plans yet.

27:55.833 --> 27:58.233
Please don't tell my brother.

28:02.298 --> 28:04.000
[Italian Bakery]

28:04.000 --> 28:05.967
Sun Young!

28:05.967 --> 28:07.833
I packed it since you barely ate.

28:07.833 --> 28:09.367
Plenty of castella.

28:09.367 --> 28:10.912
You like it, right?

28:10.912 --> 28:13.100
[Italian Bakery]

28:13.100 --> 28:14.133
How did you know?

28:14.133 --> 28:18.667
Back then, Tae Joo used
to take snacks for you a lot.

28:19.968 --> 28:23.433
Oh, so you're the one
who'd pack snacks for me...

28:24.200 --> 28:25.933
You remember, huh?

28:27.133 --> 28:29.467
You must've meant a lot to him.

28:29.467 --> 28:31.100
Me?

28:31.100 --> 28:34.367
It's not easy to care
for a friend's sibling, you know.

28:35.300 --> 28:36.900
Is that so?

28:37.833 --> 28:40.233
Let's go. I'll take you home.

28:40.233 --> 28:41.833
No, it's okay.

28:41.833 --> 28:45.000
I just feel bad.

28:45.000 --> 28:46.467
I'm not very comfortable

28:46.467 --> 28:48.608
getting in a car alone with a man.

28:52.000 --> 28:54.767
I'll enjoy this, thank you.

28:57.500 --> 28:59.867
- Then...
- You go ahead.

28:59.867 --> 29:01.500
Take care.

29:36.986 --> 29:38.560
- Darn you.
- Oh, wait...

29:39.386 --> 29:40.900
Please wait!

29:40.900 --> 29:43.300
What's your problem? Why are you doing this?

29:43.300 --> 29:45.400
It was you, right? You hit Sun Young?

29:45.400 --> 29:49.833
Do you even know
what kind of humiliation she went through?

29:49.833 --> 29:51.300
I'm a victim too.

29:51.300 --> 29:53.000
And I didn't mean for it to happen like that.

29:53.000 --> 29:54.100
You punk!

29:54.100 --> 29:56.533
I... I was wrong.

29:56.533 --> 29:58.667
Please forgive me, I'm begging you.

29:58.667 --> 30:00.667
You should be asking Sun Young
for forgiveness.

30:00.667 --> 30:03.133
You don't even know
what kind of woman she is, do you?

30:03.133 --> 30:04.933
You're being fooled too.

30:04.933 --> 30:08.333
I just saw her fooling
around with another guy.

30:08.333 --> 30:10.433
Shut up!

30:10.433 --> 30:12.167
She's such a tramp!

30:12.167 --> 30:14.867
She just goes around
seeing different guys, no matter who it is.

30:14.867 --> 30:16.600
I said shut up!

30:18.746 --> 30:20.512
Darn you!

30:21.434 --> 30:23.072
No, wait...

30:25.056 --> 30:27.744
Darn you!

30:33.667 --> 30:34.800
Go to hell!

30:34.800 --> 30:36.933
Go to hell, you punk!

30:36.933 --> 30:38.567
Go to hell!

30:42.867 --> 30:45.133
He covered his face?

30:46.100 --> 30:47.767
Why?

30:47.767 --> 30:51.733
Mr. Kang, could you take a look at this?

30:54.700 --> 30:56.300
This is...

30:58.867 --> 30:59.900
Where did you get this?

30:59.900 --> 31:04.233
It was found about 200 meters
from the crime scene.

31:11.933 --> 31:13.728
Right,

31:13.728 --> 31:15.600
this belongs to Min Ji.

31:16.300 --> 31:18.067
It's a scarecrow?

31:26.467 --> 31:30.400
Doesn't it look like she drew it
after seeing the suspect?

31:32.733 --> 31:33.900
[Kangseng Bookstore]
What did you leave behind?

31:33.900 --> 31:37.833
My art tube. My drawings are in it.

31:39.033 --> 31:41.400
This was at the scene?

31:42.300 --> 31:44.867
You remember these students?

31:46.567 --> 31:48.067
Oh, this one.

31:48.067 --> 31:50.367
Yeah, she came by the other day.

31:51.700 --> 31:52.800
Is this yours?

31:52.800 --> 31:54.933
Yes, thank you.

31:54.933 --> 31:58.133
It's late. Do you think
you can go by yourself?

31:58.133 --> 32:01.133
I'm fine. It's just a quick bus ride.

32:01.133 --> 32:03.000
Goodbye.

32:03.000 --> 32:04.667
Goodbye.

32:10.800 --> 32:13.000
She should've gone home earlier.

32:13.000 --> 32:15.467
It's really dangerous these days.

32:16.256 --> 32:19.000
Huh? It's raining.

32:20.600 --> 32:22.133
This won't do.

32:22.133 --> 32:24.200
Ki Hwan, I'll bring her
an umbrella and head off first.

32:24.200 --> 32:25.800
Alright.

32:34.333 --> 32:35.500
[Kangseng Bookstore]
About what time was that?

32:35.500 --> 32:40.400
It was right before the bookstore closed,
so just before eight?

32:40.400 --> 32:42.433
And when did he get home after that?

32:42.433 --> 32:44.867
Ki Beom? Ki Beom didn't come home.

32:44.867 --> 32:46.200
What?

32:46.200 --> 32:47.333
He does that sometimes.

32:47.333 --> 32:51.333
He hangs out and crashes
at his friends' places.

32:51.333 --> 32:54.567
Ki Hwan, where is Ki Beom now?

32:54.567 --> 32:56.967
Why are you acting like this?

32:56.967 --> 32:58.067
It's...

32:58.067 --> 33:00.200
- Lee Ki Beom!
- Welcome.

33:00.200 --> 33:02.233
Lee Ki Beom, come out!

33:02.933 --> 33:05.000
- Mr. Kim?
- Mr. Kang.

33:05.000 --> 33:06.967
Mr. Kang, what brings you here?

33:06.967 --> 33:09.067
This is our team's case.

33:10.033 --> 33:11.167
What case?

33:11.167 --> 33:13.967
You know Jeon Kyeong Ho,
the one who got involved with you.

33:13.967 --> 33:14.967
Yes, what about that punk?

33:14.967 --> 33:17.100
He was assaulted and taken to the hospital.

33:17.100 --> 33:18.567
He's unconscious.

33:18.567 --> 33:20.600
Wait, don't tell me the suspect is...

33:20.600 --> 33:22.267
Yeah, Lee Ki Beom.

33:22.267 --> 33:24.233
What? Ki Beom?

33:24.233 --> 33:25.933
Where is Lee Ki Beom right now?

33:25.933 --> 33:27.900
Oh, well...

33:29.900 --> 33:32.367
Let's step outside for a moment and talk.

33:33.567 --> 33:35.433
I'll call you later.

33:38.167 --> 33:40.160
So,

33:40.160 --> 33:42.033
the key witness in a murder case

33:42.033 --> 33:43.900
is a suspect in another case?

33:43.900 --> 33:46.433
Yes, and the suspect seems to be on the run.

33:46.433 --> 33:47.967
Jeon Kyeong Ho again? Seriously?

33:47.967 --> 33:49.500
Is he faking it again?

33:49.500 --> 33:51.267
He's a pro at forging medical reports.

33:51.267 --> 33:52.867
He's actually unconscious this time.

33:52.867 --> 33:54.900
This is different from the last time
with Mr. Kang.

33:55.867 --> 33:58.333
I'll step out for a moment.

33:58.333 --> 34:01.500
What's the rush? Where are you off to now?

34:07.300 --> 34:09.700
You have a visitor.

34:13.786 --> 34:15.667
Oh.

34:15.667 --> 34:16.833
You can clock out now.

34:16.833 --> 34:18.433
Yes, sir.

34:22.300 --> 34:27.733
So the last place Kim Min Ji went
before getting killed was that bookstore?

34:27.733 --> 34:31.400
She may have been with Lee Ki Beom.

34:31.400 --> 34:33.733
We need Ki Beom's statement.

34:34.800 --> 34:36.867
[Cha Si Young]
So, about that...

34:37.500 --> 34:41.333
I'd like to resolve the Jeon Kyeong Ho case
with a settlement.

34:41.333 --> 34:44.700
Like you said,
assault is prosecuted upon complaint.

34:44.700 --> 34:49.200
I want you to wrap things up
with Jeon Kyeong Ho.

34:49.933 --> 34:51.667
Can you do it?

34:52.667 --> 34:57.167
So we can drop that charge
and take full control of the case?

34:59.233 --> 35:02.533
Okay, I'll handle Jeon Kyeong Ho.

35:02.533 --> 35:05.200
You go find Lee Ki Beom first.

35:06.067 --> 35:07.633
You see?

35:07.633 --> 35:11.833
Things are easier when we work together.

35:11.833 --> 35:14.300
You do your job, and I do mine.

35:14.300 --> 35:16.400
Isn't that perfect?

35:19.833 --> 35:21.700
Why me?

35:21.700 --> 35:24.200
There are plenty of capable detectives.

35:26.202 --> 35:27.733
Well,

35:27.733 --> 35:29.967
there aren't many people I trust.

35:33.133 --> 35:34.933
You trust me?

35:35.833 --> 35:38.400
Why don't you try trusting me too?

35:40.700 --> 35:43.300
I'll get going. I've got a lot to do.

35:44.600 --> 35:46.367
Hey, wait,

35:46.367 --> 35:49.733
aren't you overlooking something?

35:49.733 --> 35:51.333
Based on what you've said,

35:51.333 --> 35:56.067
Lee Ki Beom sounds more like a suspect
than a witness.

35:56.067 --> 35:57.667
Am I wrong?

36:12.433 --> 36:14.467
Ji Won, Ji Won!

36:14.467 --> 36:16.867
Why the fuss again? What is it?

36:16.867 --> 36:18.067
Something big happened.

36:18.067 --> 36:19.200
What is it?

36:19.200 --> 36:23.033
Jeon Kyeong Ho was assaulted
and is in a coma.

36:23.033 --> 36:25.933
What? Who on earth did it?

36:25.933 --> 36:27.488
Well,

36:27.488 --> 36:29.667
they say it was Ki Beom.

36:30.767 --> 36:33.133
Who?

36:33.133 --> 36:34.233
Attempted murder?

36:34.233 --> 36:38.000
Well, he had strangulation marks on his neck.

36:38.000 --> 36:39.733
[Kangseng Police Station]
His condition's not good, either.

36:39.733 --> 36:42.567
And the suspect? Have they been caught?

36:42.567 --> 36:44.200
Not yet.

36:44.200 --> 36:45.833
Sun Young!

36:46.833 --> 36:48.433
Ji Won.

36:51.067 --> 36:52.667
What brings you here?

36:52.667 --> 36:55.033
I came to bring Tae Joo some underwear.

36:55.033 --> 36:57.400
Did you hear about Jeon Kyeong Ho too?

37:00.800 --> 37:04.600
We've had a bad history,
but it still doesn't feel right

37:04.600 --> 37:06.033
that he went through all that.

37:06.033 --> 37:09.333
Don't take it to heart.
It has nothing to do with you.

37:10.067 --> 37:12.333
Still, they say it was attempted murder.

37:12.333 --> 37:15.546
Did the suspect really try
to kill Jeon Kyeong Ho?

37:16.867 --> 37:18.000
No way, he would never...

37:18.000 --> 37:19.833
- Huh?
- What?

37:21.867 --> 37:25.367
I mean, is killing someone that easy?

37:25.367 --> 37:27.233
Oh, it's hot!

37:28.250 --> 37:29.767
Oh, no.

37:29.767 --> 37:32.200
- You're so clumsy, seriously.
- Oh, dear.

37:33.267 --> 37:35.000
Did you get burned?

37:35.000 --> 37:36.067
It's okay.

37:36.067 --> 37:37.467
- Go.
- Yeah, take care.

37:37.467 --> 37:39.733
- Yeah, bye.
- I'll get going.

37:39.733 --> 37:42.067
- Take care!
- Yeah.

38:10.867 --> 38:12.533
Go to hell!

38:23.267 --> 38:24.400
Help!

38:24.400 --> 38:26.467
Somebody help!

38:31.733 --> 38:33.333
Sun Young.

38:39.000 --> 38:40.633
You...

38:46.167 --> 38:47.167
Over there!

38:47.167 --> 38:49.667
Someone collapsed over there! Hurry!

38:56.200 --> 38:58.167
No one will suspect anything here.

38:58.167 --> 39:00.500
Don't do this, Sun Young.

39:00.500 --> 39:02.210
We have nothing to do

39:02.210 --> 39:04.067
with each other anymore.

39:04.067 --> 39:06.700
Then why did you do that?

39:06.700 --> 39:09.667
What am I to you for you to go that far?

39:10.400 --> 39:12.967
I'll turn myself in.

39:15.233 --> 39:17.800
I did it.

39:17.800 --> 39:19.467
I'll take responsibility.

39:20.467 --> 39:23.133
What if they find out
you went to the protest?

39:24.300 --> 39:27.733
They say even the student president disappeared
without a trace.

39:28.346 --> 39:29.792
But...

39:32.500 --> 39:37.133
Just hide here for now
and see how things unfold.

39:40.567 --> 39:42.467
Let's run away.

39:42.467 --> 39:43.467
What are you talking about?

39:43.467 --> 39:47.000
If you get caught now,
you could be framed with attempted murder.

39:49.533 --> 39:51.167
What?

39:57.216 --> 39:58.651
Darn it.

40:02.233 --> 40:04.300
Are you coming to your senses?

40:07.900 --> 40:09.333
Oh, dear.

40:09.333 --> 40:11.733
What are you doing here?

40:11.733 --> 40:14.400
I heard you need eight weeks to recover.

40:14.400 --> 40:18.467
Well, you reap what you sow.

40:20.000 --> 40:22.367
Are you here to mock me?

40:22.367 --> 40:25.600
That's harsh to someone
who came visit out of concern.

40:26.867 --> 40:29.433
But why did you go there again?

40:29.433 --> 40:31.833
Why went to Kang Sun Young?

40:32.533 --> 40:35.467
To tell her what kind of person you are.

40:36.200 --> 40:39.333
You told me to counter-sue her
for false accusation

40:39.333 --> 40:41.280
and frame it as an affair.

40:41.280 --> 40:44.067
That was all you, Cha Si Young.

40:44.067 --> 40:46.000
She doesn't know any of that,

40:46.000 --> 40:49.500
and she was all smiles
and happy to be with you.

40:49.500 --> 40:52.767
How could you look her in the eye and smile?

40:56.900 --> 40:59.900
What does that have to do with you?

40:59.900 --> 41:02.100
Huh?

41:02.100 --> 41:03.933
Listen carefully.

41:03.933 --> 41:08.100
The assault was just bad luck.

41:08.100 --> 41:10.733
You just tripped and fell while walking.

41:10.733 --> 41:15.067
So drop any thoughts of pressing charges
or anything like that.

41:15.067 --> 41:16.967
If you understand, nod.

41:21.100 --> 41:22.100
Why should I?

41:22.100 --> 41:23.900
So I can be screwed over by you twice?

41:23.900 --> 41:27.233
No way. My uncle is the county governor.

41:28.100 --> 41:29.467
Yeah.

41:29.467 --> 41:33.900
I can make
that title of 'governor's nephew' disappear.

41:33.900 --> 41:35.424
Okay?

41:36.267 --> 41:40.600
Want me to put your dear uncle
in cuffs for bribery?

41:41.400 --> 41:43.567
If you don't believe me,
ask him how much he took.

41:43.567 --> 41:45.833
Do you think I'm saying this
without evidence?

41:48.600 --> 41:50.700
Now, answer me.

42:01.500 --> 42:03.200
Good.

42:10.333 --> 42:11.600
Why are you doing this to me?

42:11.600 --> 42:13.767
What did I ever do to you?

42:13.767 --> 42:15.667
I have no hard feelings toward you.

42:15.667 --> 42:19.533
It's a request from a dear friend,
so I have no choice.

42:20.667 --> 42:23.333
Your face is pretty messed up.

42:23.333 --> 42:26.733
Take care of yourself. Quietly.

42:38.752 --> 42:40.924
Darn you.

42:43.600 --> 42:47.833
What now? I said I'd do what you told me!

42:50.490 --> 42:52.960
Hey, wait...

42:52.960 --> 42:58.208
No, wait...

43:03.000 --> 43:05.667
Let me ask one more thing.

43:05.667 --> 43:08.167
How did you find out about my mother?

43:10.333 --> 43:12.320
Was that

43:12.320 --> 43:13.867
Cha Si Young too?

43:14.682 --> 43:17.306
[Social Affairs Department]

43:26.700 --> 43:28.333
Oh, this...

43:31.194 --> 43:33.600
Oh, no.

43:33.600 --> 43:35.433
It's okay.

43:48.200 --> 43:53.067
The suspect's handkerchief
is the same as Sun Young's?

43:53.067 --> 43:54.667
How is that possible?

43:59.767 --> 44:01.300
[Kangseng Daily]
But see this? He covered his face.

44:01.300 --> 44:03.000
Ms. Kim Mi Yeon didn't mention that.

44:03.000 --> 44:06.733
So he only covered his face in front of me?
Why?

44:08.267 --> 44:10.500
This handkerchief looks familiar.

44:14.400 --> 44:16.200
This can't be.

44:18.667 --> 44:20.300
No way.

44:21.433 --> 44:25.267
[Resignation Letter]

44:28.500 --> 44:32.800
I didn't realize
you were the superintendent's brother.

44:32.800 --> 44:36.100
Next time, don't go through him.

44:36.100 --> 44:38.048
Just tell me directly if you need anything.

44:38.048 --> 44:41.400
How could a mere prosecutor do that?

44:42.533 --> 44:45.333
Then I'll take these to him myself.

44:45.333 --> 44:46.933
- Yes.
- That's okay, right?

44:46.933 --> 44:48.500
Yes.

44:48.500 --> 44:50.667
Please tear this up.

45:06.500 --> 45:08.800
But why did you go there again?

45:08.800 --> 45:10.700
Why went to Kang Sun Young?

45:10.700 --> 45:12.533
[Jeon Kyeong Ho]

45:12.533 --> 45:15.900
To tell her what kind of person you are.

45:15.900 --> 45:19.000
You told me to counter-sue her
for false accusation

45:19.000 --> 45:20.928
and frame it as an affair.

45:20.928 --> 45:23.367
That was all you, Cha Si Young.

45:42.567 --> 45:45.133
How did you find out about my mother?

45:45.133 --> 45:46.733
Was that

45:47.367 --> 45:49.000
Cha Si Young too?

45:49.633 --> 45:54.600
Cha Si Young was the one
who first brought up your family background.

45:55.500 --> 45:57.533
Thinking back now,

45:57.533 --> 45:59.833
it was all bait.

46:09.033 --> 46:13.667
[Kang Tae Joo, son of a bar hostess]

46:13.667 --> 46:15.633
Hey! Get out of the way!

46:16.640 --> 46:18.304
Darn it.

46:26.458 --> 46:27.616
Darn it.

46:42.433 --> 46:44.767
Oh, Kang Tae Joo!

46:47.167 --> 46:50.300
I wrapped up the Jeon Kyeong Ho case nicely.

46:50.300 --> 46:52.767
You won't be bothered anymore.

46:52.767 --> 46:55.000
I took care of your resignation too.

46:55.000 --> 46:57.433
Now just focus on the investigation.

47:02.900 --> 47:04.192
Why?

47:04.192 --> 47:05.933
Something wrong?

47:07.000 --> 47:08.767
Why did you do that?

47:09.400 --> 47:12.100
- What?
- Why did you do that to my sister?

47:15.467 --> 47:17.633
What did you gain from it?

47:20.967 --> 47:22.933
- It's a misunderstanding.
- A misunderstanding?

47:26.300 --> 47:27.933
Fine, you won't believe anything I say.

47:27.933 --> 47:29.504
But

47:29.504 --> 47:32.267
I was trying to help you in my own way.

47:32.267 --> 47:34.933
That's just nonsense.

47:34.933 --> 47:36.933
Tae Joo.

47:36.933 --> 47:38.800
Don't you trust me?

47:38.800 --> 47:40.700
Man, that hurts.

47:40.700 --> 47:43.200
I'm trying this hard.

47:47.267 --> 47:49.440
Then

47:49.440 --> 47:52.367
why did you do that to me back then?

47:52.367 --> 47:53.400
Back then?

47:53.400 --> 47:55.267
Back then.

47:55.267 --> 47:57.667
I begged you.

47:57.667 --> 48:02.267
I got beaten like a dog and pleaded.

48:02.267 --> 48:05.100
I begged you not to say
that one thing, but...

48:05.833 --> 48:07.433
Why did you do that?

48:08.533 --> 48:10.167
Huh?

48:14.167 --> 48:16.067
You can't answer, can you?

48:16.733 --> 48:18.567
Because there was no reason.

48:19.967 --> 48:22.533
It was just a joke to you.

48:22.533 --> 48:24.033
Does that even matter?

48:24.033 --> 48:25.667
What?

48:26.700 --> 48:29.267
It's all in the past.

48:29.267 --> 48:30.867
Wow, in the past?

48:30.867 --> 48:33.433
Tae Joo, the past is just the past.

48:33.433 --> 48:37.833
What matters is
what you and I will do together going forward.

48:37.833 --> 48:42.200
Why should we always be held back
by something so trivial?

48:42.200 --> 48:44.800
I said I'd do better from now on.

48:44.800 --> 48:47.567
Let's just forget everything and start fresh.

48:47.567 --> 48:50.467
Why do you always have to ruin it?

48:50.467 --> 48:52.100
Tae Joo.

48:55.900 --> 49:00.533
Cut me some slack just once, okay?

49:00.533 --> 49:03.533
I'll do better, I promise.

49:03.533 --> 49:05.133
Okay, Kang Tae Joo?

49:07.833 --> 49:09.952
Why does it have to be now,

49:09.952 --> 49:12.133
of all times?

49:12.767 --> 49:14.367
What?

49:15.133 --> 49:16.900
Forget it?

49:16.900 --> 49:17.900
Who says I can just forget?

49:17.900 --> 49:21.133
Do you think I remember it because I want to?

49:22.767 --> 49:24.767
Cha Si Young.

49:24.767 --> 49:27.400
I'll make sure you remember this clearly too.

49:28.067 --> 49:31.067
You're the one
who insisted on messing with me,

49:31.067 --> 49:34.667
back then, and now.

49:34.667 --> 49:36.267
Tae Joo!

49:40.200 --> 49:42.833
I found the owner of the handkerchief.

49:42.833 --> 49:44.433
Hurry.

49:48.667 --> 49:50.900
Handkerchief?

49:50.900 --> 49:52.733
The owner?

50:05.400 --> 50:07.050
This is

50:07.050 --> 50:09.200
Sun Young's handkerchief?

50:10.100 --> 50:12.233
- See the embroidery here?
- Yeah.

50:14.167 --> 50:16.800
Sun Young made this herself.

50:16.800 --> 50:21.067
The only person who could have a matching one
is Ki Beom.

50:24.900 --> 50:26.533
Wait a second.

50:27.322 --> 50:29.167
[Choi Min Ja Case Report]

50:29.167 --> 50:31.933
[Non-Prosecution Decision Log]
You're thinking what I'm thinking, right?

50:33.300 --> 50:35.100
That's impossible.

50:36.633 --> 50:38.433
That kid...

50:39.167 --> 50:41.467
There's no way he'd do that.

50:41.467 --> 50:43.600
Oh, Ms. Seo, you're here.

50:43.600 --> 50:45.500
Hello.

50:45.500 --> 50:47.800
Ms. Sun Young came by during the day.

50:47.800 --> 50:49.333
The underwear and socks are there.

50:49.333 --> 50:52.544
Right, earlier Sun Young
was talking about Jeon Kyeong Ho.

50:52.544 --> 50:54.200
Did you bring it up first, Mr. Park?

50:54.200 --> 50:55.333
No.

50:55.333 --> 50:56.500
She already knew about it.

50:56.500 --> 50:58.133
Sun Young knew
what happened to Jeon Kyeong Ho?

50:58.133 --> 51:00.567
- Yes.
- How?

51:00.567 --> 51:03.933
I just assumed you had told her, sir.

51:08.224 --> 51:10.033
Oh, Mr. Park.

51:10.033 --> 51:11.067
Yes.

51:11.067 --> 51:14.300
Get as many officers as you can right now

51:14.300 --> 51:16.233
and search the entire area
around my place for Lee Ki Beom.

51:16.233 --> 51:18.400
Yes, sir!

51:18.400 --> 51:19.967
Hey!

51:19.967 --> 51:22.900
- Tae...
- Tae Joo, I drove Sun Young home earlier.

51:26.233 --> 51:28.767
[Kang Tae Joo]

51:33.267 --> 51:34.800
No intercity buses.

51:34.800 --> 51:39.000
Let's just get to Heesong Station first
and take a train from there.

51:39.667 --> 51:41.300
Ki Beom!

51:41.300 --> 51:44.433
Ki Beom! What are you doing?

51:44.433 --> 51:46.500
Ki Beom, open it!

51:47.133 --> 51:50.033
Ki Beom!

51:59.733 --> 52:01.400
Ki Beom!

52:35.200 --> 52:37.833
He must have gone to the bus stop.

56:03.267 --> 56:05.533
Sun Young!

56:05.533 --> 56:06.633
Are you okay?

56:06.633 --> 56:08.933
Open your eyes!

56:08.933 --> 56:11.000
Sun Young!

56:11.000 --> 56:12.600
Sun Young!

56:52.800 --> 56:55.700
Tae Joo, this...

57:00.267 --> 57:03.133
What kind of clothes are these?

57:03.133 --> 57:05.500
Don't walk alone at night.

57:05.500 --> 57:07.100
Sun Young!

57:08.967 --> 57:10.000
Tae Joo!

57:10.000 --> 57:11.000
Ji Won, you stay here.

57:11.000 --> 57:12.133
- Let's go together!
- People are coming.

57:12.133 --> 57:14.000
Tell them what happened.

57:17.967 --> 57:19.600
Sun Young!

57:22.200 --> 57:23.800
Sun Young!

57:26.533 --> 57:28.200
Kang Sun Young!

57:29.400 --> 57:31.633
Sun Young, please...

57:31.633 --> 57:33.333
Kang Sun Young!

57:33.333 --> 57:34.600
Who's there?

57:34.600 --> 57:35.667
It's me, Tae Joo.

57:35.667 --> 57:37.100
Cha Si Young?

57:37.100 --> 57:39.433
Did you fire the shot?

57:39.433 --> 57:41.100
Hey!

57:43.133 --> 57:44.167
Sun Young!

57:44.167 --> 57:46.267
Hey, Sun Young...

57:46.267 --> 57:47.433
What happened?

57:47.433 --> 57:48.433
Hey, Sun Young!

57:48.433 --> 57:51.867
Don't worry. She just passed out.

57:51.867 --> 57:53.667
- Hey, Sun Young!
- That punk

57:53.667 --> 57:55.700
was after Sun Young.

57:59.767 --> 58:01.667
Sun Young, wake up.

58:01.667 --> 58:03.300
Sun Young!

58:05.433 --> 58:07.033
Hey, Cha Si Young!

58:09.533 --> 58:11.633
What's wrong with you?

58:11.633 --> 58:13.233
Cha Si Young!

58:19.967 --> 58:22.433
Hey, what just happened?

58:22.433 --> 58:23.667
Are you okay?

58:23.667 --> 58:25.267
Hey, Cha Si Young!

58:26.667 --> 58:28.267
I...

58:29.300 --> 58:31.767
Actually, I knew.

58:31.767 --> 58:33.408
That you

58:33.408 --> 58:35.900
always packed snacks for your sister.

58:35.900 --> 58:38.633
Why bring that up all of a sudden?
Shut up, you punk!

58:40.033 --> 58:41.792
If I hadn't gone

58:41.792 --> 58:44.567
just to deliver that back then,

58:45.633 --> 58:47.533
we'd have been fine, right?

58:47.533 --> 58:50.267
I told you to shut up, you punk!

58:53.100 --> 58:55.600
Get Sun Young something to eat.
She's been whining since earlier.

58:55.600 --> 58:57.233
Mom!

58:58.400 --> 59:00.800
Can I go to college?

59:00.800 --> 59:04.033
Go, earn the money and go.

59:29.933 --> 59:31.633
Father...

59:57.200 --> 59:58.833
I thought

01:00:00.000 --> 01:00:01.600
you were

01:00:02.400 --> 01:00:05.267
my father's son.

01:00:09.200 --> 01:00:10.688
But

01:00:10.688 --> 01:00:13.800
I can't stand brothers.

01:00:14.833 --> 01:00:17.033
Friends are fine, though.

01:00:23.067 --> 01:00:25.333
- I feel dizzy...
- Hey, Cha Si Young!

01:00:25.333 --> 01:00:28.300
Stay with me, man!

01:00:28.300 --> 01:00:29.300
No!

01:00:29.300 --> 01:00:32.900
Hey, you punk! Stay with me!

01:00:32.900 --> 01:00:34.033
Cha Si Young!

01:00:34.033 --> 01:00:36.333
Hey, man, come to your senses!

01:00:37.000 --> 01:00:38.633
Hey, Cha Si Young!

01:01:30.167 --> 01:01:32.067
Got you!

01:01:32.867 --> 01:01:35.267
You little rat!

01:02:13.000 --> 01:02:14.900
[Keep Quiet]
You can't come in.

01:02:23.633 --> 01:02:26.200
[In Surgery]

01:02:26.200 --> 01:02:27.567
[Restricted Area]

01:02:27.567 --> 01:02:29.200
Si Young.

01:02:30.533 --> 01:02:31.700
Don't die.

01:02:31.700 --> 01:02:33.667
[Operating Room]

01:02:33.667 --> 01:02:35.300
Please...

01:02:42.133 --> 01:02:44.033
Oh, come on. Tell me.

01:02:44.900 --> 01:02:47.100
You trusted that person once, didn't you?

01:02:49.500 --> 01:02:51.400
No, never. Not even once.

01:02:51.400 --> 01:02:55.100
Come on, then how could you
even team up with someone like that?

01:02:55.100 --> 01:02:57.267
This is no fun.

01:02:57.267 --> 01:03:00.200
Professor, I can tell you're lying.

01:03:04.833 --> 01:03:07.867
Do you still keep in touch with him?

01:03:08.833 --> 01:03:10.467
No.

01:03:11.467 --> 01:03:14.333
Do you know how he's doing now?

01:03:15.167 --> 01:03:16.800
I don't.

01:03:18.633 --> 01:03:20.700
Another lie.

01:03:24.064 --> 01:03:28.600
You're worse at lying than I expected.

01:03:29.233 --> 01:03:31.800
That's a bit unfair, isn't it?

01:03:34.000 --> 01:03:36.000
This is your last chance.

01:03:36.000 --> 01:03:37.933
No more lies this time.

01:03:37.933 --> 01:03:40.600
Or no more visits from now on.

01:03:45.033 --> 01:03:47.400
Did teaming up with that friend

01:03:47.400 --> 01:03:51.800
become a turning point
in your life, Professor?

01:03:53.100 --> 01:03:55.233
Was it for the better,

01:03:55.967 --> 01:03:57.967
or for the worse?

01:04:01.733 --> 01:04:03.600
The worse.

01:04:05.700 --> 01:04:08.000
Because I lost everything.

01:04:08.667 --> 01:04:10.467
You're lying again...

01:04:17.633 --> 01:04:19.467
Wait, it's true?

01:04:28.200 --> 01:04:30.333
I lost everything.

01:05:02.600 --> 01:05:03.600
Kang Sun Young, who is it?

01:05:03.600 --> 01:05:04.767
You're not seriously
suspecting Ki Beom, are you?

01:05:04.767 --> 01:05:06.333
If it wasn't Lee Ki Beom, who was it?

01:05:06.333 --> 01:05:07.500
It's all circumstantial evidence.

01:05:07.500 --> 01:05:09.033
You are still not sure

01:05:09.033 --> 01:05:11.067
that Lee Ki Beom is the killer?

01:05:11.067 --> 01:05:12.767
A murder case?

01:05:12.767 --> 01:05:13.833
How many times is this now?

01:05:13.833 --> 01:05:15.267
Can anyone even live like this?

01:05:15.267 --> 01:05:17.333
- We will catch the killer.
- Then do your darn job.

01:05:17.333 --> 01:05:19.600
He escaped the scene
and hid at Lee Joo Hee's house.

01:05:19.600 --> 01:05:21.233
The route lines up perfectly.
So does the timeline.

01:05:21.233 --> 01:05:23.367
Even now, you still think
Lee Ki Beom isn't the real killer?

01:05:23.367 --> 01:05:25.967
Are you suspecting Ki Beom too?

01:05:25.967 --> 01:05:28.067
Ki Beom is a serial murder suspect.

01:05:28.067 --> 01:05:30.533
We must find Ki Beom, ma'am.
